{"654550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Football Game", "steam_appid": 654550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [804030], "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out our latest game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>A short new Lynchian point and click thriller from the creators of A Date in the Park!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>STORY:</i></h2>East Bend, Purchase County. 1987.<br><br>You are Tommy, a local high school football hero in the town of East Bend. It’s game night for the Purchase County Turbines and your sweetheart is waiting in the bleachers.<br><br>However, something is amiss...<br><br>Join Tommy for a night you won’t forget!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>FEATURES:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A traditional point and click adventure game aesthetic with puzzles and dialogue interactions familiar to the genre.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cast of characters including friends, foes, teachers, and a concerned mother.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, twisted narrative with approximately 1 to 2 hours of gameplay, depending on the player.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An award-winning original soundtrack by UK duo JUPITER-C - also available via DLC </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>INSPIRATIONS:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traditional point and click adventure games from the '80s and '90s.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The music and films of David Lynch.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Young love.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<i>A short new Lynchian point and click thriller from the creators of A Date in the Park!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>STORY:</i></h2>East Bend, Purchase County. 1987.<br><br>You are Tommy, a local high school football hero in the town of East Bend. It’s game night for the Purchase County Turbines and your sweetheart is waiting in the bleachers.<br><br>However, something is amiss...<br><br>Join Tommy for a night you won’t forget!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>FEATURES:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A traditional point and click adventure game aesthetic with puzzles and dialogue interactions familiar to the genre.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cast of characters including friends, foes, teachers, and a concerned mother.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, twisted narrative with approximately 1 to 2 hours of gameplay, depending on the player.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An award-winning original soundtrack by UK duo JUPITER-C - also available via DLC </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>INSPIRATIONS:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traditional point and click adventure games from the '80s and '90s.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The music and films of David Lynch.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Young love.</li></ul>", "short_description": "You are Tommy, a local high school football hero in the town of East Bend. It’s game night for the Purchase County Turbines and your sweetheart is waiting in the bleachers. Join Tommy for a night you won’t forget...", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain", "reviews": "“The perfect low-budget creepy curiosity.”<br>Destructoid<br><br>“If you’re looking for a short indie point-and-click that delivers its disturbing narrative with aplomb, this should take you to the end zone. Go Turbines!”<br>Adventure Gamers<br><br>“Uncomfortable, surreal and occasionally brilliant, Football Game sticks with you like the taste of sh*t tequila and two packs of cigarettes. It captures a certain small town vibe, crushes it up with Lynchian-esque vibes and a great soundtrack that all prop up the great narrative and neat puzzles.”<br>Raw Fury<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654550/header.jpg?t=1783589557", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783589557", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654550/capsule_18